tion but not \"dependency added\". A CHANGELOG reader wants to know new dependency. Add under Added: \"vcpkg.json: добавлена зависимость boost-process\".\n  7. Missing `tests/e2e/e2e_runner_test.cpp` (runner self-tests), `expected_points.hpp` shared, common helper `e2e_test.hpp`, unit test conversion? Wait Unreleased already contains earlier items: unit tests migration, help/version, etc. The 3 new points are layer 20. Maybe `Boost.Process` dependency should be in Added.\n  8. Missing mention of `t4` radius empty semantics? No.\n  9. Missing removal of `tests/expect` and `cases.cmake`; included.\n  10. Missing `run_case`/`check` from README? Changelog doesn't care.\n  11. Version section: it's under Unreleased; correct structure.\n  12. Ordering: Changed before Added before Removed; Keep a Changelog commonly Added/Changed/Deprecated/Removed/Fixed, but order is not mandated; they have Changed, Added, Removed. Fine, though standard order usually Added first. Not an error.\n  13. Existing Unreleased has many items from previous work; fine.\n\nQuestion: \"стоит ли более подробно описать? есть ли ошибки?\" Answer:\n- Keep it concise: detail belongs in README; but each entry should be understandable standalone. The current three are okay in intent but have inaccuracies/vagueness. Recommend moderate expansion, not exhaustive.\n- Specific corrections:\n  1. Line 37: `tests/e2e/*` are sources, not `.exe`; rewrite as \"исходники матричных e2e-тестов t1–t4: e2e_runner, e2e_test/e2e_case, tN_cases.hpp, tN_e2e.cpp, expected_*.hpp, CMake-функция add_e2e_test; тесты раннера\".\n  2. Add Boost dependency: `vcpkg.json` + `boost-process`; mention `boost::process::v1`.\n  3. Line 22: maybe clarify \"t1–t4\" and \"boost::process::v1\" and that test counting semantics changed (3 ctest entries → one TEST_P with 3 checks). The last is useful but not necessary; perhaps one sentence.\n  4. Removed: typo; specify \"каталог tests/expect\" and \"tests/cases.cmake\"; mention \"старая тройка тестов на кейс (код/канал/пустота) заменена одним gtest-тестом\".\n  5. Maybe Added: \"общий helper e2e_test.hpp (имена тестов + единое тело проверки)\" and \"expected_points.hpp\".\n  6. `README` already detailed; Changelog need not duplicate. One or two bullets each is enough.\n- Also check line 37 \"тест. матрицы\" abbreviation; okay.\n- Check line 22 \"чекер\" informal; okay.\n- Maybe mention \"Boost.Process v1\" not \"Boost.Process\" to avoid v2 confusion.\n- Check \"tests/unit\" earlier entries duplicate? no.\n\nCould there be an error: line 22 says \"e2e-тесты перенесены на gtest + Boost.Process\" — yes. But line 37 Added says \"tests/e2e/* - сами .exe e2e тестов...\" sounds like new; migration is changed; having both is fine, but Added should be about new files, not duplicate.\n- Removed line 43-44: \"и все упоминаня данных файлов в системе сборки cmake и системе тестов ctest\" — \"в системе тестов ctest\" is inaccurate: removing files removes ctest registrations generated by CMake; ctest isn't configured by those files directly. Rephrase \"и их регистрация в CMake/CTest\".\n- Typo \"упоминаня\".\n- Also line 44 says \"тестовые кейсы, tests/expect - файловые ожидания\" grammar; fine.\n\nMaybe check if `vcpkg.json` diff is indeed in Unreleased? Since 0.1.0 section ends at 100 lines; check if boost dependency mentioned anywhere. Grep CHANGELOG for boost.",
